[32m+[m[32m## Phase 4 — OCR & document opening[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mWhen a document is saved, text-based PDFs are extracted with Poppler. Images and scanned PDFs are processed with the local Tesseract installation; OCR is best-effort, so a missing OCR runtime does not prevent the original document from being archived. Extracted text is stored in the `documents.ocr_text` SQLite column and is included in the existing search field. OCR is local and no document content is sent to an external service.[m
